T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Statement: Perform the following operations using 8-bit 2''s complement) Tj
T*
(arithmetic and verify whether arithmetic overflow occurs: \(A\) \(+68\) - \(+35\), and \(B\)) Tj
T*
(\(+85\) + \(+60\).) Tj
T*
(Mathematical Execution:) Tj
T*
(* Part A: \(+68\) - \(+35\) = \(+68\) + \(-35\):) Tj
T*
(- +68 in binary = 01000100_2.) Tj
T*
(- +35 in binary = 00100011_2 -> 1''s comp = 11011100 -> 2''s comp \(-35\) = 11011101_2.) Tj
T*
